OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPaul and Dave hope to impress
OL,7,     Ftheir guests with some country
OL,8,     Fclass at the Coach and Horses in
OL,9,     FCompton, West Sussex. But there
OL,10,     Fare decor disagreements, and the
OL,11,     Fbreakfast fry-up falls flat.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition. After dramatic
OL,15,     Fdiscoveries and score settling on
OL,16,     Feverything from missing bulbs to
OL,17,     FTV troubles, the payments are
OL,18,     Frevealed and the winner is
OL,19,     Fannounced.
