OL,12,G1750 The Dog House Australia
OL,13,     FUntil recently, the Bankens were
OL,14,     Fhomeless. Now the family want a
OL,15,     Fdog to make their new house a
OL,16,     Fhome. Meg and Matt are smitten
OL,17,     Fwith Travis; is the feeling
OL,18,     Fmutual?
